    (2) Drop_depth: list_filter at tc_scope.oo:28-43 replaces the O(K^2) char-rebuild loop.
        Verify the function uses `str_ends_with` (in HEAD's runtime) and not substring matching.
    (3) Scope_has: list scan at tc_scope.oo:11-26. Verify per-depth `name@d` compare.
    (4) Env.oo red herring: PV2 confirmed env.oo was not the cause. Verify the audit doc
